{"root":"gaji","ipa":"/ɡadʒi/","core":"指雇员因提供劳动或服务而定期获得的报酬，即工资、薪水。","pos":["名词"],"scenes":["高频","工作"],"rootBlock":{"ipa":"/ɡadʒi/","zh":"工资，薪水","phrases":[{"t":"gaji pokok","zh":"基本工资"},{"t":"kenaikan gaji","zh":"加薪"},{"t":"potongan gaji","zh":"扣薪"}],"examples":[{"t":"Dia menerima gaji setiap akhir bulan.","zh":"他每个月底领工资。"},{"t":"Perusahaan itu menaikkan gaji karyawannya.","zh":"那家公司提高了员工的薪水。"}]},"ders":[{"w":"gaji","ipa":"/ɡadʒi/","zh":"工资","phrase":{"t":"gaji buta","zh":"白拿工资（指不干活却领薪水）"},"example":{"t":"Jangan hanya makan gaji buta.","zh":"不要只拿钱不干活。"}},{"w":"menggaji","ipa":"/məŋɡadʒi/","zh":"支付工资，雇佣","phrase":{"t":"menggaji karyawan","zh":"支付员工工资"},"example":{"t":"Perusahaan itu mampu menggaji banyak staf.","zh":"那家公司有能力支付许多员工的工资。"}},{"w":"penggajian","ipa":"/pəŋɡadʒian/","zh":"工资发放，薪酬管理","phrase":{"t":"sistem penggajian","zh":"薪酬体系"},"example":{"t":"Proses penggajian dilakukan secara otomatis.","zh":"工资发放流程是自动完成的。"}}],"derSlugs":["gaji","menggaji","penggajian"],"model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","createdAt":"2026-09-26T16:32:48.460Z","src":"base"}